/T (  The budget position, in turn, is influenced by a range of factors including the level of economic activity, the rate of interest and any tax reforms undertaken. A number of European countries have recently introduced flat rate tax systems. Fig. 2 shows when a flat tax was introduced in a number of European countries and how the rate of income tax changed due to the introduction and the rate in 2016.)
